        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to face a new danger that threatens the whole world in the new part Elven Rivers 7! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expedition to the unknown has begun! Before Celine and her friends lie the snowy wastes and icy silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the mysterious northern continent seems uninhabited only at first glance: a dark power, as cruel as it is ancient, is waiting to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a small group of heroes resist the invasion of an entire army of undead? Will it be possible to stop the spread of the taint that turns all living things to ice? But the big question is: is Celine ready to face the grim truth about her kin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elven Rivers is a time-management game with worker assignment: on each level you quickly gather resources (food, wood, etc.), build and upgrade structures (farm, sawmill, workers’ house), clear obstacles, and manage to complete the objectives for ‘3 stars’ before the timer runs out, using temporary boosts (speed-up, time stop, construction speed-up).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy storyline and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level structure and rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes: relaxed storytelling or a relentless race against time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrades and find collectible items</p></li></ul>",
